    </head>

    <body>

        <!-- Navigation Bar -->
        <header>
            <nav class="navbar">
                <h2 class="logo">AI<span>Future</span></h2>

                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#about">About AI</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#technology">Technology</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#applications">Applications</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#future">Future</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section id="home" class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <p class="tagline">EXPLORE THE WORLD OF INTELLIGENCE</p>

                <h1>Discover the <span>Future</span> of Artificial Intelligence</h1>

                <p>
                    Artificial Intelligence is transforming the world.
                    Explore how intelligent machines are changing
                    industries, solving problems and creating new possibilities.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#about" class="btn">Explore AI</a>
                    <a href="#applications" class="btn outline">Discover Applications</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="ai-circle">
                    <span>AI</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- About AI -->
        <section id="about" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">What is <span>Artificial Intelligence?</span></h2>

            <div class="about-container">
                <div class="about-image">
                    <div class="brain">🧠</div>
                </div>

                <div class="about-content">
                    <h3>Understanding Artificial Intelligence</h3>

                    <p>
                        Artificial Intelligence, commonly known as AI,
                        is a branch of computer science that focuses on
                        creating machines and systems capable of performing
                        tasks that normally require human intelligence.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        These tasks include learning, reasoning,
                        problem-solving, understanding language,
                        recognizing images and making decisions.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        AI is becoming an important part of modern life,
                        from virtual assistants to healthcare and education.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- AI Technologies -->
        <section id="technology" class="section technology">
            <h2 class="section-title">Core AI <span>Technologies</span></h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                Explore the technologies that make intelligent systems possible.
            </p>

            <div class="technology-grid">

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">🤖</div>
                    <h3>Machine Learning</h3>
                    <p>
                        Enables computers to learn from data
                        and improve their performance without
                        being explicitly programmed for every task.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">🧠</div>
                    <h3>Deep Learning</h3>
                    <p>
                        Uses neural networks with multiple layers
                        to recognize patterns and solve complex problems.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">💬</div>
                    <h3>Natural Language Processing</h3>
                    <p>
                        Helps computers understand, interpret
                        and generate human language.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">👁️</div>
                    <h3>Computer Vision</h3>
                    <p>
                        Allows machines to understand and
                        analyze images and videos.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">⚙️</div>
                    <h3>Robotics</h3>
                    <p>
                        Combines AI and engineering to create
                        machines that perform physical tasks.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">✨</div>
                    <h3>Generative AI</h3>
                    <p>
                        Creates new content such as text,
                        images, audio and computer code.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Applications -->
        <section id="applications" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Applications of <span>AI</span></h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                Artificial Intelligence is making a difference across many industries.
            </p>

            <div class="application-grid">

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🏥</div>
                    <h3>Healthcare</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI helps doctors analyze medical images,
                        identify patterns and support medical research.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🎓</div>
                    <h3>Education</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI supports personalized learning,
                        intelligent tutoring and educational tools.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🚗</div>
                    <h3>Transportation</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI helps improve traffic management,
                        navigation and autonomous vehicle technology.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🏦</div>
                    <h3>Banking</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI helps detect suspicious transactions,
                        identify fraud and analyze financial data.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🌾</div>
                    <h3>Agriculture</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI can help monitor crops, analyze soil
                        and support smarter farming decisions.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="application-card">
                    <div class="app-icon">🏭</div>
                    <h3>Industries</h3>
                    <p>
                        AI supports automation, quality inspection
                        and predictive maintenance.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Benefits -->
        <section class="section benefits">
            <h2 class="section-title">Why is <span>AI Important?</span></h2>

            <div class="benefits-container">

                <div class="benefit-card">
                    <h3>⚡ Faster Work</h3>
                    <p>AI can automate repetitive tasks and process information quickly.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="benefit-card">
                    <h3>🎯 Better Analysis</h3>
                    <p>AI can analyze large amounts of data and identify useful patterns.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="benefit-card">
                    <h3>🌍 Innovation</h3>
                    <p>AI helps researchers and developers explore new solutions.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="benefit-card">
                    <h3>🤝 Assistance</h3>
                    <p>AI tools can support people in learning, creating and working.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Future of AI -->
        <section id="future" class="section future">
            <div class="future-content">
                <p class="tagline">TOMORROW STARTS TODAY</p>

                <h2>The Future of <span>Artificial Intelligence</span></h2>

                <p>
                    AI continues to develop and influence the way
                    people live and work. It may create new opportunities
                    in science, education, healthcare, transportation
                    and many other fields.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Responsible development, human oversight,
                    privacy and fairness will be important as AI evolves.
                </p>

                <a href="#contact" class="btn">Explore the Future</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact -->
        <section id="contact" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Get in <span>Touch</span></h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                Interested in Artificial Intelligence? Let's connect and learn together.
            </p>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <form>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                    <textarea rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn">Send Message</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer>
            <h2>AI<span>Future</span></h2>
            <p>Exploring Intelligence. Building Tomorrow.</p>
            <p>© 2026 AI Future. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            <a href="#home">Back to Top ↑</a>
        </footer>

    </body>

